ACE ToolkitRelease NotesMay 23, 1990Current Version is 1.2P(d2).  ACEVersion returns $8102.Change Historyd2	JAM:  Rearranged direct page to provide for 16-byte "saxel info" chunk	beginning at DP address $00.  Moved between-call state information	for expansion into the saxel chunk, shiften all ACE dp variables below $80	up by $10 locations.  Arrangement of dp variables at $80 and above is	unchanged.  This change to ACE should make absolutely NO DIFFERENCE	whatsoever in its function.  However, if there are third party apps	out there that rely on knowledge about the ACE dp gained by reverse-	engineering the code, they may break, since none of the variables below	$80 are in the same places anymore.  Dem's de breaks, methinks.Latest Documentation	ACE ERS version 01:11, dated 7 April 1988.  Please refer to it for specific	information concerning the changes mentioned above.  The version 01:10 ERS also	correctly describes the tool, except that the ACEStatus call was incorrectly	named ACEActive.  The name change does not affect code that was compiled or	assembled to the 01:10 spec, as the call number and interface have not changed,	but the new call name should be used by future software.Known Bugs	None.